### ===================================================================
### QUORUM IDENTITYSERVER & API GATEWAY - ADMIN REST API (CRUD SUITE)
### ===================================================================
### Ten plik zawiera gotowe żądania HTTP dla wszystkich modułów CRUD
### w Quorum.Backend.AdminAPI. Możesz go uruchamiać w Visual Studio,
### VS Code (REST Client) lub JetBrains Rider.

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001/api/admin
@authToken = Bearer TWOJ_BEARER_TOKEN_TUTAJ
@contentType = application/json

### ===================================================================
### 1. DASHBOARD & STATYSTYKI
### ===================================================================

### 1.1. Pobierz podsumowanie i statystyki pulpitu
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/stats
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}


### ===================================================================
### 2. KLIENCI OAUTH2 / OIDC (CLIENTS)
### ===================================================================

### 2.1. Pobierz listę klientów (stronicowanie i wyszukiwanie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients?search=spa&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.2. Pobierz szczegóły klienta po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.3. Utwórz nowego klienta (SPA / Authorization Code + PKCE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "clientId": "frontend-spa-portal",
  "clientName": "Frontend Single Page Application (React/Vue)",
  "description": "Klient SPA używający Authorization Code Flow z PKCE",
  "enabled": true,
  "requireClientSecret": false,
  "requirePkce": true,
  "allowPlainTextPkce": false,
  "allowAccessTokensViaBrowser": true,
  "allowedGrantTypes": [
    "authorization_code"
  ],
  "allowedScopes": [
    "openid",
    "profile",
    "email",
    "quorum.api",
    "quorum.gateway"
  ],
  "redirectUris": [
    "https://localhost:3000/callback",
    "https://portal.example.com/callback"
  ],
  "postLogoutRedirectUris": [
    "https://localhost:3000/",
    "https://portal.example.com/"
  ],
  "allowedCorsOrigins": [
    "https://localhost:3000",
    "https://portal.example.com"
  ],
  "accessTokenLifetime": 3600,
  "identityTokenLifetime": 300,
  "allowOfflineAccess": true
}

### 2.4. Aktualizuj istniejącego klienta
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "clientId": "frontend-spa-portal",
  "clientName": "Frontend Single Page Application (Zaktualizowana)",
  "description": "Zaktualizowany opis klienta SPA",
  "enabled": true,
  "requireClientSecret": false,
  "requirePkce": true,
  "allowedGrantTypes": [
    "authorization_code",
    "refresh_token"
  ],
  "allowedScopes": [
    "openid",
    "profile",
    "email",
    "quorum.api"
  ],
  "redirectUris": [
    "https://localhost:3000/callback"
  ],
  "postLogoutRedirectUris": [
    "https://localhost:3000/"
  ],
  "allowedCorsOrigins": [
    "https://localhost:3000"
  ],
  "accessTokenLifetime": 7200
}

### 2.5. Dodaj sekret (Client Secret) do klienta Machine-to-Machine
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients/1/secrets
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "description": "Główny sekret produkcyjny API",
  "value": "SuperTajneHasloKlienta123!#",
  "type": "SharedSecret",
  "expiration": "2028-12-31T23:59:59Z"
}

### 2.6. Usuń sekret klienta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clients/1/secrets/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 2.7. Usuń klienta
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 3. ZAKRESY API (API SCOPES)
### ===================================================================

### 3.1. Pobierz listę zakresów API
GET {{baseUrl}}/scopes?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3.2. Pobierz szczegóły zakresu API po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/scopes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3.3. Utwórz nowy zakres API (Scope)
POST {{baseUrl}}/scopes
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "quorum.admin.full",
  "displayName": "Pełny dostęp do API Administracyjnego Quorum",
  "description": "Umożliwia pełne zarządzanie tożsamością, konfiguracją i trasami bramki",
  "enabled": true,
  "required": false,
  "emphasize": true,
  "showInDiscoveryDocument": true,
  "userClaims": [
    "role",
    "permission",
    "department"
  ]
}

### 3.4. Aktualizuj zakres API
PUT {{baseUrl}}/scopes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "quorum.admin.full",
  "displayName": "Pełny dostęp do API Administracyjnego Quorum (Aktualizacja)",
  "description": "Zaktualizowany zakres uprawnień",
  "enabled": true,
  "required": false,
  "emphasize": true,
  "showInDiscoveryDocument": true,
  "userClaims": [
    "role",
    "email",
    "permission"
  ]
}

### 3.5. Usuń zakres API
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/scopes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 4. ZASOBY TOŻSAMOŚCI (IDENTITY RESOURCES)
### ===================================================================

### 4.1. Pobierz listę zasobów tożsamości
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4.2. Pobierz szczegóły zasobu tożsamości po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4.3. Utwórz nowy własny zasób tożsamości
POST {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "tenant_info",
  "displayName": "Informacje o Organizacji / Najemcy",
  "description": "Udostępnia identyfikator firmy, rolę organizacyjną i subskrypcję",
  "enabled": true,
  "required": false,
  "emphasize": false,
  "showInDiscoveryDocument": true,
  "userClaims": [
    "tenant_id",
    "tenant_name",
    "tenant_role"
  ]
}

### 4.4. Aktualizuj zasób tożsamości
PUT {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "tenant_info",
  "displayName": "Informacje o Organizacji (Aktualizacja)",
  "description": "Zaktualizowany zasób organizacyjny",
  "enabled": true,
  "required": false,
  "showInDiscoveryDocument": true,
  "userClaims": [
    "tenant_id",
    "tenant_name",
    "tenant_role",
    "company_tier"
  ]
}

### 4.5. Zainicjalizuj standardowe zasoby OIDC (openid, profile, email, address, phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources/seed
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 4.6. Usuń zasób tożsamości
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/identity-resources/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 5. UŻYTKOWNICY ASP.NET CORE IDENTITY (USERS)
### ===================================================================

### 5.1. Pobierz listę użytkowników
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?search=admin&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.2. Pobierz szczegóły użytkownika po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.3. Pobierz listę dostępnych ról w systemie
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/roles
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5.4. Utwórz nowego użytkownika
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "userName": "jan.kowalski@example.com",
  "email": "jan.kowalski@example.com",
  "emailConfirmed": true,
  "phoneNumber": "+48123456789",
  "phoneNumberConfirmed": true,
  "twoFactorEnabled": false,
  "lockoutEnabled": true,
  "password": "StrongPassword123!#",
  "roles": [
    "Admin",
    "Manager"
  ],
  "claims": [
    { "type": "department", "value": "IT Security" },
    { "type": "location", "value": "Warsaw" }
  ]
}

### 5.5. Aktualizuj dane użytkownika i role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": "user-guid-id-tutaj",
  "userName": "jan.kowalski@example.com",
  "email": "jan.kowalski@example.com",
  "emailConfirmed": true,
  "phoneNumber": "+48987654321",
  "twoFactorEnabled": true,
  "roles": [
    "Admin"
  ],
  "claims": [
    { "type": "department", "value": "Core Architecture" }
  ]
}

### 5.6. Zmień / Zresetuj hasło użytkownika
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj/change-password
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "newPassword": "NoweBezpieczneHaslo2026!#"
}

### 5.7. Zablokuj konto użytkownika
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj/toggle-lockout
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "lockAccount": true
}

### 5.8. Odblokuj konto użytkownika
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj/toggle-lockout
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "lockAccount": false
}

### 5.9. Usuń użytkownika
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/user-guid-id-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 6. FEDERACJE OIDC / SINGLE SIGN-ON (FEDERATIONS)
### ===================================================================

### 6.1. Pobierz listę dostawców federacji OIDC
GET {{baseUrl}}/federations?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.2. Pobierz szczegóły dostawcy po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/federations/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6.3. Zwaliduj i przetestuj endpoint OIDC Discovery
POST {{baseUrl}}/federations/test-discovery
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "authority": "https://accounts.google.com"
}

### 6.4. Zarejestruj nowego dostawcę federacji OIDC (np. Keycloak / Entra ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/federations
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "scheme": "Google-SSO",
  "displayName": "Zaloguj przez Google Workspace",
  "authority": "https://accounts.google.com",
  "clientId": "google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com",
  "clientSecret": "google-client-secret",
  "responseType": "code",
  "scope": "openid profile email",
  "isEnabled": true,
  "saveTokens": true,
  "getClaimsFromUserInfoEndpoint": true
}

### 6.5. Aktualizuj dostawcę federacji
PUT {{baseUrl}}/federations/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "scheme": "Google-SSO",
  "displayName": "Google Workspace SSO (Włączony)",
  "authority": "https://accounts.google.com",
  "clientId": "google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com",
  "clientSecret": "nowy-google-client-secret",
  "responseType": "code",
  "scope": "openid profile email",
  "isEnabled": true
}

### 6.6. Przełącz status dostawcy (Włącz/Wyłącz)
POST {{baseUrl}}/federations/1/toggle
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "isEnabled": false
}

### 6.7. Usuń dostawcę federacji
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/federations/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 7. REGUŁY API GATEWAY & TESTER REVERSE PROXY
### ===================================================================

### 7.1. Pobierz listę tras Gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/gateway/routes?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7.2. Pobierz szczegóły trasy Gateway po ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/gateway/routes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7.3. Utwórz nową trasę Gateway (z szablonami grup {version}/{resource})
POST {{baseUrl}}/gateway/routes
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pathPattern": "^/api/v(?<ver>\\d+)/(?<res>[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+)(?:/(?<rest>.*))?$",
  "isRegex": true,
  "upstreamBaseUrl": "https://internal-microservice.local:8443",
  "upstreamPathPattern": "/internal/{res}/v{ver}/{rest}",
  "requiredScope": "quorum.api",
  "isEnabled": true,
  "order": 100,
  "allowedMethods": "GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,PATCH,OPTIONS",
  "transformHeadersJson": "{\"X-Forwarded-By\":\"Quorum-Gateway\",\"X-Service-Tier\":\"Production\"}"
}

### 7.4. Aktualizuj trasę Gateway
PUT {{baseUrl}}/gateway/routes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "pathPattern": "^/api/v(?<ver>\\d+)/(?<res>[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+)(?:/(?<rest>.*))?$",
  "isRegex": true,
  "upstreamBaseUrl": "https://internal-microservice.local:8443",
  "upstreamPathPattern": "/internal/{res}/v{ver}/{rest}",
  "requiredScope": "quorum.api",
  "isEnabled": true,
  "order": 50,
  "allowedMethods": "GET,POST,PUT,DELETE,PATCH,OPTIONS",
  "transformHeadersJson": "{\"X-Forwarded-By\":\"Quorum-Gateway-v2\"}"
}

### 7.5. Przetestuj trasę w Symulatorze Gateway (Ewaluacja Regex i Mapowania Upstream)
POST {{baseUrl}}/gateway/test
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "method": "GET",
  "path": "/api/v2/orders/45829/items",
  "queryString": "?includeDetails=true",
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJSUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "scopes": [
    "quorum.api",
    "openid"
  ]
}

### 7.6. Usuń trasę Gateway
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/gateway/routes/1
Authorization: {{authToken}}


### ===================================================================
### 8. AKTYWNE GRANTY, TOKENY I ZGODY (PERSISTED GRANTS)
### ===================================================================

### 8.1. Pobierz listę aktywnych grantów (RefreshToken, UserConsent itp.)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants?type=refresh_token&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8.2. Pobierz szczegóły pojedynczego grantu po kluczu
GET {{baseUrl}}/grants/sample-grant-key-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 8.3. Unieważnij pojedynczy grant / token
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grants/sample-grant-key-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 8.4. Unieważnij wszystkie tokeny i sesje dla danego użytkownika (SubjectId)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grants/subject/user-guid-id-tutaj
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 8.5. Unieważnij wszystkie tokeny wydane dla danego klienta (ClientId)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/grants/client/frontend-spa-portal
Authorization: {{authToken}}
